# Per-cycle working directories (<YYYYMMDD>/<HH>/): GRIB2 inputs, npz intermediates,
# NetCDF output and plots. A single 24-hour cycle is ~9 GB of NetCDF alone, and this
# checkout has accumulated ~47 GB of them. aws/run_on_ec2.sh excludes the same
# pattern when packaging the working tree for an instance.
[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/
logs/
*.npz
*.grib2
*.grib2.idx
# xESMF regridding weights: 116 MB, and make_bcs regenerates it when absent.
gfs_to_hrrr_weights.nc
.DS_Store
